                                "sense_id": "71975c25-6b86-3abb-8366-5219fb4f6b44",
                                "text": "In fact, the most inversive of all such moves is Goffman's use of players as models for those involved in serious activities."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "89f82145-21b4-4a53-b752-3ebc429f1902",
                                "sense_id": "71975c25-6b86-3abb-8366-5219fb4f6b44",
                                "text": "The more inversive, peer-oriented, outdoor activities precede Halloween, while the family gatherings, meal, fireworks, and bonfire all take place on Halloween itself."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
